TECHNICAL_CONTEXT_EXPOSURE_AUDIT.md

.vercel

# Claude Code agent harness — local worktrees for parallel agent runs
.claude/worktrees/

# WS1 observe-walk — local-only GCS service-account key for the read-back (never commit)
.gcs-credentials.json

# ── LevelStory Session 1 (data discovery) — credential guard ──
# The EODHD API key must NEVER be committed. `.env` and its variants are already
# ignored above; the following are belt-and-suspenders for any stray credential
# material that could land inside the study working directories.
*.key
*.pem
*.token
.eodhd_key
eodhd_key*
discovery/**/*.secret
discovery/**/.env*

# ── LevelStory Session 2 (fetch/normalize) — data is NEVER committed ──
# The full dataset is multi-GB. Only code, config, tests, docs, and the small fetch
# manifest (copied to docs/discovery/) are committed. Fixtures under fixtures/ ARE
# committed (small characterization samples) and are intentionally not matched here.
research/level-study/data/
# Session 7 aggregation + manual-validation artifacts (reports, chart packets, grades) are
# generated founder-local from the full dataset and are never committed (S7 §1).
research/level-study/reports/
research/**/.env*
research/**/*.secret
research/**/*.key

# Mastery ENFORCEMENT flip-ceremony artifacts (B4): the pre-flip census
# report carries per-user entitlement data and the approved-keys file is a
# founder-local decision record — never committed.
mastery-preflip-census-report.json
mastery-preflip-approved*.json
mastery-backfill-report.json

# Composition migration-scan output (B4): dry-run reports are operator-local;
# the APPLY report is copied into docs/audits/ deliberately, never auto-committed.
scripts/composition/out/
